<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Worldwide H1 net up 98 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Worldwide H1 net up 98 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  21.09   vs	  10.67</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 13.2    vs	   6.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		    52.50   vs	  37.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    33.25   vs	  17.79</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  2.04   vs  less   1.13</p>
<p>Note - Worldwide Holdings Bhd is a property-based company.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
